mapping "X905.1" source="X905" target="219186006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X905 SNOMED CT 219186006 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides X90
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45756458) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 440599 = (sctid 219186006), the verified Athena crosswalk target for X90
